        "name": "Blob lease acquisition using BlobLeaseClient",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses getBlobLeaseClient() on BlockBlobClient, acquireLease() with configurable duration, and releaseLease(). Properly passes leaseId to subsequent operations."
      },
      {
        "name": "Uses BlockBlobClient.uploadStream()",
