        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Correctly uses uploadStream() with fs.createReadStream() instead of uploadData() or upload() with buffers."
      },
      {
        "name": "NOT using connection strings or account keys",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses DefaultAzureCredential with endpoint URL. No connection strings or account keys anywhere in code."
      },
      {
        "name": "NOT collecting all listed blobs into array before processing",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "listBlobs() collects all blobs into an array via blobs.push(blob) inside the for-await loop, then returns the full array. This is the anti-pattern the criterion warns against."
      }
    ]
  },
